	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I turn to face the voice behind me.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"That's right. I have to report the outcome of my battle to my lord.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I silently kneel before her.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have neutralized the enemy.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well done.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"I bow my head deeply at Akari's words.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Even I am startled by how naturally my body moves.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Even without my memories, my body remembers the conduct of a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Akari stares into my eyes with a complicated expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Any injuries?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Akari averts her gaze to look over my body.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“None at all.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Unbelievably, my severed left hand has been somehow restored.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Every last one of my wounds has been completely sealed.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"What in the world happened to my body?",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"This defies all common sense.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hahaha, Soujin, are you sure you're even human?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Akari bursts into a smile.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I get caught up in her mood and let out a smile as well, and all of the tension vacates my body.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could say the same to you. What happened to your broken arm?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please, this is nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We need to treat Hotori, too. Let's go find Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Akari doesn't move.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's enough now. We can stop playing at lord and servant.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not playing in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are my one and only lord.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry, but I don't feel the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not worthy of being a lord.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"She nonchalantly rebuffs me.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sure acted like my lord in that battle just now.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, it was just an act. I was desperate.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't care if it's an act.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You entrusted your fate to your vassal and sent him into battle by your own command.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And you saw everything through to the end.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should understand by now.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That courage is what makes you worthy of being my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Her eyes widen at my words.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, you alone are my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Courage...”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Akari mutters to herself.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"After a moment of silence, she faintly smiles, as though recalling a distant memory.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was lacking in courage.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When I got kidnapped, when you were fighting Inou, I\ncouldn't bear to see you get hurt.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was willing to sacrifice myself if it meant you'd be saved.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But this whole time, I was wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I just didn't have the courage to see your fate through to the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You were fighting with your life on the line, but I was running away from my own battle.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Akari lets her hands fall to her side and clenches them tightly.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"She then raises her clenched fists to her chest.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"That the courage contained within them might reach her heart.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not only today, but three years ago, you put your life on the line to protect me.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'd thank you, but you'd just say you were doing your duty, wouldn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Akari is absolutely right.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"She knows how I feel all too well.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's why I won't thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Instead, I'll fulfill my duty and meet your resolve with my own.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"A wholly different aura envelops Akari.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Her eyes of amaranthine nobility peer into me.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Her lips of efflorescent Persica weave my name.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Not just her words, but the very quality of her voice is entirely different.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As one who bears the blood of the Imperial Family, the task before me remains yet unfinished.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I ask you once more: here and now, offer to me your body and your life.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No matter where or when you meet your end, I shall accept your everything... I shall accept your soul itself.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I shudder at her words.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Every last one of my senses is the dominion of this existence known to the world as Miyaguni Akari.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"─How many days... how many thousands of years have I been waiting for this moment?",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Even though I've lost all my pre-war memories, I know this to be my true purpose.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is an undeserved honor.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I lower my head as deeply as I can.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"As though it was written in the fates from the moment I was born into this world, I bow before Akari.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior is his lord's blade.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even should my life be extinguished, I shall forge a blade from my very soul to smite my enemies.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your sincere words have not gone unheard.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Our gazes intertwine.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Now and truly, the flame of fealty is burning deep within my body.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I am a papier-mache warrior no longer.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I am the blade of my lord, a true warrior.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"I shall protect this girl even at the cost of my life.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"This girl that shines with a dazzling light. This priceless jewel by the name of Miyaguni Akari.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I would like you to promise me one thing.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It is a request I make precisely because you are my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Akari says with a serene smile.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do not give into despair and die before me.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No warrior is capable of saving one who does not wish to live.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey! What do you think I...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Her indignation is rapidly replaced by a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I promise. No matter what, I won't die before you.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is all I ask.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are now my life itself.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I would not be able to endure seeing you die.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's awfully selfish for the guy who wanted me to have more courage.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors have it easy. All we have to do is fight and die.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Akari gives an exasperated laugh.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Can I ask for a promise in exchange?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm glad you're risking your life for me, but try and take better care of yourself as well.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even my courage has its limits, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Akari smiles in satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Just seeing that expression fills me with an indescribable sense of contentment.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Is this what it means to serve a lord?",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“From the bottom of my heart, I feel blessed by Oomikami that I was able to meet you.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Me too, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"As Akari's expression contorts as though she's weeping tears of joy, petals of Persica flutter madly all around her.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"They appear out of thin air and fade away before they touch the snow on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is this an illusion?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Akari denies it, wiping at the corners of her eyes for some reason.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“These peach petals are my tears.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For as long as I've lived, I've never been able to shed a single tear.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"There's no way...",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"It really is you...",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Two voices resound in my chest at the same time.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I have the blood of the Imperial Family, so it would've been nice to have a more useful power.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see... So you're crying right now.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can't even hide my tears. How embarrassing, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Akari shows me a smile that reaches her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The petals of Persica dance on the wind with even greater intensity.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Come to think of it, I've seen these mysterious petals many times now.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"When we saw the light of the souls in the Warrior District─",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"When she showed me the Dance of Persica─",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"And now, in this moment, as we exchange our vows─",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're actually a big crybaby, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't tell anyone. It'll be our little secret.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But this will be the last time I ever cry in front of you.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure I'll be sending you into battle many more times from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So isn't it a little too unfair if I'm the only one crying about it?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Akari smiles a radiant smile.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"That smile of hers, fleeting as the gentle spring haze, lightly traces over the recesses of my heart and lacerates me to the core.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then this too will be the last time I make you cry.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I catch a single petal on my fingertip.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"A teardrop of Persica, slightly warm to the touch.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"When I bring it to my lips, it vanishes as sweetly as an ephemeral dream.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			hide=1,
			{
"They scatter...",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Fluttering from the sky.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			hide=1,
			{
"One petal of Persica, and another.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Alas, o beloved, tell me why.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Must you continue your fight, even unto your tears run dry?",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama! Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Kotone comes running from afar.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank goodness... You were able to find each other.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All thanks to the clue you gave me. Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is an honor to have been of service, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes dart back and forth between me and Akari.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, you seem to have a different presence about you...”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And Soujin-sama, your physique seems to have somehow improved...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haha, you might be right!”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Grr, please do not brush me off...”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wai─Akari-sama, you are terribly injured! And why might Hotori-sama be lying unconscious over there?!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll explain everything later. But first, they need Healing.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, but of course, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"At that moment, Republic-style fanfare rings out from the direction of the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"The Armistice Day ceremony has begun.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like we can watch it from over there.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, please permit me to tend to your injuries!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm fine. Heal Inou first, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I move next to Akari in a spot with a good view.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"The Republican occupation zone shimmers in the snow.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Republican tanks advance in a column through what was once the central artery of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Hired Imperials are lined up on either side of the boulevard, waving flags.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Look how close those soldiers are to the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"The Republic and Okonogi's reign is steadily being advanced.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Humans are creatures that adapt to their circumstances.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"The countless anti-government movements that sprouted up following the war have largely been cut down.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"If Empress Hisui's engagement is announced today, that number will dwindle even further.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"We haven't a moment to waste in making our stand.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's do everything we can to make this view look different by this time next year.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll see to it that I put you on that stage.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"I stare at the ceremonial stage in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"It's lined with Republican dignitaries in full dress uniform.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"This time next year, the one standing in that spot will be the girl beside me─",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Miyaguni Akari.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come on. Let's get going.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Side-by-side, we set off.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"To take back the Empire, with our powers combined.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"The roar of an intense explosion rocks my body.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Plumes of black smoke erupt from the venue of the ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wh...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“An... explosion?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Akari stares at the venue in a daze.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"The wind carries the sound of screams to our ears.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Was it an accident? Or was it premeditated?",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"If so, by whom? For what purpose?",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"What of the fate of Empress Hisui? Okonogi? The Republic officials?",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"The billowing smoke swallows up all my questions as it stains the sky of Tenkyo pitch-black.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Early spring, Tenkyo─",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"It seems that spring is still far off.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
